    "detailed_description": "I can't stand this any longer.<br><br>Each night I think that I will become another person tomorrow.<br><br>Each night I think that I will <strong>finally</strong> do this.<br><br>Begin to live.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155730/extras/12d23e96a9cf31b97a30f8169448343d.poster.avif?t=1692194949\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155730/extras/12d23e96a9cf31b97a30f8169448343d.gif?t=1692194949\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br>A short novel about problems with loss of taste for life, existential emptiness and the crisis of psychological care in Russia. Will you be able to get out of the circle of destructive thought?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155730/extras/8b180abf9394773136ed1b0a1708f8c9.poster.avif?t=1692194949\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2155730/extras/8b180abf9394773136ed1b0a1708f8c9.gif?t=1692194949\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br>\u25a0 Six endings;<br><br>\u25a0 Art drawn by single-pixel brush;<br><br>\u25a0 A melancholic soundtrack in the melodic noise genre.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Warning</h2>The game contains mentions of aggravated depressive states and alcohol consumption. Not suitable for people with epilepsy.",
